_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"WEEKEND20 applied → \\\"- 20% off\\\"; remove button cleared it; WELCOME10 applied → \\\"- 10% off\\\"; after submit the reservation card shows \\\"Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\" (localStorage couponCode:\\\"WELCOME10\\\").\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Calendar for Aug 2026 (today Aug 28): all cells 1–28 rendered disabled, only 29 onward selectable; Aug 29 + available time 19:00 was accepted and produced a confirmed reservation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Reservation date cannot be changed — modify dialog offers no date control\", \"actual\": \"The \\\"Modify Reservation\\\" dialog contains only \\\"New Time\\\" and \\\"Party Size\\\" selects plus Save Changes/Close (dialog text: \\\"Modify Reservation / New Time / 19:00 / Party Size / 2 Guests / Save Changes / Close\\\"). Time (19:00→20:30) and party size (2→6) saved and are displayed correctly, but there is no way to change the date, which remained August 29, 2026.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Review submission is not gated by a completed reservation\", \"actual\": \"On Sakura Garden (restaurant 2) the user had NO reservation at all (only an upcoming one at The Golden Fork). The \\\"Write a Review\\\" tab was fully available and a 5-star review by \\\"QA Tester\\\" was accepted and persisted (tablespot_reviews now contains restaurantId \\\"2\\\" / \\\"QA Tester\\\"), immediately appearing in the review list and raising the displayed rating to 5.0. No eligibility check and therefore no one-review-per-completed-reservation limit exists.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Day-of-week and first-reservation coupon eligibility rules are not enforced\", \"actual\": \"WEEKEND20 was accepted for a reservation on Monday, Aug 31 2026 (shown as applied, \\\"- 20% off\\\"). WELCOME10 (first-reservation offer) was also accepted while the user already had 1 existing reservation in tablespot_reservations, giving \\\"- 10% off\\\". Only the party-size rule works (GROUP15 with 2 guests → \\\"Coupon Not Applicable: This coupon requires a party of 6 or more.\\\"). The single-coupon rule holds: once a coupon is applied the code input/Apply button is replaced by the applied badge + remove button.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Missing/invalid required reservation information is never identified to the user\", \"actual\": \"Clicking \\\"Confirm Reservation\\\" with a completely empty form, and again with date+time set but empty name/email/phone, and again with name/phone filled but email \\\"not-an-email\\\", each time silently did nothing: no toast, no inline error, no aria-invalid, no field highlighting (queried [data-sonner-toast],[role=alert],[role=status],[aria-invalid=true] → all empty) and localStorage tablespot_reservations stayed \\\"[]\\\". The same toast query DOES return coupon errors, proving toasts are detectable, so the form genuinely gives zero feedback.\", \"evidence\": \"Creation is correctly blocked, but the user receives no indication of what is missing or invalid.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Modify opens a dialog with New Time / Party Size and \\\"Save Changes\\\" persisted 20:30 / 6 Guests. Cancel opens \\\"Cancel Reservation?\\\" dialog; \\\"Keep Reservation\\\" left the booking untouched (Upcoming still 2, status confirmed), only \\\"Cancel Reservation\\\" applied the cancellation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Create → \\\"Reservation Confirmed!\\\" panel with \\\"View My Reservations\\\"; modify → dialog closes and the card instantly shows 20:30 / 6 Guests; cancel → item instantly moves from Upcoming (2) to Past (1) with \\\"Cancelled\\\" badge. All updates occurred in-session with no reload (no toast is shown for modify/cancel, but the views update immediately and visibly).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Separate \\\"Upcoming (n)\\\" and \\\"Past (n)\\\" tabs; upcoming card: \\\"The Golden Fork | French · $$$$ | Upcoming | August 29, 2026 | 20:30 | 6 Guests | Downtown | Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\"; past card shows same fields with status \\\"Cancelled\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Rating shown in restaurant list is inconsistent with the detail page and is not updated by new reviews; list shows no review count\", \"actual\": \"The Golden Fork: list card shows 4.8, detail page shows 4.5 (2) — its two reviews are 5 and 4 stars. Sakura Garden: after submitting a new 5-star review the detail page rating changed to 5.0 (2), while the list card still shows the hard-coded 4.6. No review count is displayed anywhere in the list, so list and detail summaries never agree.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
